OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 26 Sep to Mon 5 OctFA
OL,6,Fcontinuation of changeable weather is
OL,7,Fexpected, as further frontal systems
OL,8,Fbring spells of rain, showers, and
OL,9,Foccasional strong winds. The wettest
OL,10,Fand windiest conditions are most
OL,11,Flikely across Scotland and Northern
OL,12,FIreland, but wet and windy weather may
OL,13,Fextend more widely across England and
OL,14,FWales at times. Between these
OL,15,Funsettled spells, periods of drier and
OL,16,Fmore settled weather are likely,
OL,17,Fespecially further south and east, and
OL,18,Fmay last for several days at a time.
OL,19,FTemperatures are expected to be
OL,20,Fslightly above normal overall, but
OL,21,Fovernight fog and frost is possible
OL,22,Fduring clearer, cooler nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
